# --- Stage A (SAR detection) --------------------------------------------
# Datasets, trained weights and inference outputs are large and regenerable;
# the code that produces them is what belongs in git. Reproduce with:
#   python -m stage_a.cli train --data-root <corpus>
# The one Stage A output that IS committed is the per-case detection artifact
# under data/cases/<id>/detection.real.json — it is small, and the demo reads
# it instead of running live inference (staged-build-reference.md Stage 39).
stage_a/data/
stage_a/checkpoints/
stage_a/artifacts/
stage_a/.venv/
*.pt
*.pth

